Title:          LinNeighborhood
Version:        0.6.5
Entered-date:   09JUN02
Description:    LinNeighborhood is a X-Window port of Windows Network
                Neighborhood. It permits to browse an SMB (CIFS) 
                network consisting of Samba, Windows (WfW, 95, 98, NT, 2000),
                ... and to mount shares
Keywords:       Samba, Network Neighborhood, browse, smbmount 
Author:         schmidjo@bnro.de (Hans Schmid)
                Richard.Stemmer@wasserburg-inn.de (Richard Stemmer)
Maintained-by:  schmidjo@bnro.de (Hans Schmid)
Primary-site:   http://www.bnro.de/~schmidjo
                400k LinNeighborhood-0.6.5.tar.gz
Platforms:      Linux, Samba, GTK+ 1.2.x
Copying-policy: GPL
End
